# Scope prettier ignore to the runtime-generated outputs under .qfai so SSOT
# sources (.qfai/specs, .qfai/assistant, .qfai/contracts)
# stay formatted. Negate only the authored files that should remain
# auto-formatted. Historical evidence markdown stays ignored so frozen records
# do not churn under auto-formatting. The parent directory is also explicitly
# un-ignored so the negated file entry survives prettier's gitignore-style
# matching.
.qfai/report/**
.qfai/tools/**
!.qfai/report/
!.qfai/report/preflight_summary.md
.qfai/review/**
.qfai/evidence/**
# The discussion pack is gone, and with it the ignore line that hid it, so a
# checkout that still holds an old pack would fail the formatting check on files
# the repository no longer tracks. The migration says to delete the directory.
.qfai/discussion/**
# The migrated decision ledger preserves archived table cells and provenance.
# Prettier expands its long cells into a multi-megabyte padded table.
.qfai/spec/decisions.md
# Exact historical pages retain reviewed bytes; validation remains required.
.qfai/spec/decisions/page-0001.md
.qfai/spec/decisions/page-0002.md
.qfai/spec/decisions/page-0003.md
# A contract keeps its business rules in one long table. Prettier pads every
# row to the widest cell, so editing one rule rewrites the whole table and
# conflicts with every concurrent edit. Tables here use the compact style
# (one space around each cell), which `lint:md` accepts.
.qfai/spec/03_contract/**
# The open-question register is one long table for the same reason: Prettier
# pads every cell to the widest one, which grew a file of under 60 lines past
# 400 KB. It keeps the compact style instead.
.qfai/spec/open-questions.md
# An archived review record is frozen, so reformatting one is churn on a
# document nobody is editing. The markdownlint globs skip it for the same reason.
.qfai/review_archive/**
pnpm-lock.yaml
tmp
*.min.js
*.min.css

# The bundle vitest writes beside a TypeScript config while it loads one, and
# deletes immediately after. The lint lanes run together, so the formatting check
# can list this file and then fail to read it — a failure that depends on timing
# and not on anything the change contains.
*.timestamp-*.mjs

# Generated QFAI artifacts (not versioned)
.qfai/review/review-*
.qfai/review_archive/review-*
.qfai/evidence/*[0-9]*.md
.qfai/evidence/*[0-9]*.json
.qfai/report/run-*
.qfai/report/validate.*
.qfai/report/report.md
.qfai/report/atdd-traceability
.qfai/report/preflight_summary.md
.qfai/report/specs-coverage
